      "id": "M4202-A",
      "skill": "industrial-ai-paper-router-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "prompt": "Request A: 当前只校准工业问题与写法。一个诊断分类器在两种已知负载条件的数据上与基线比较；没有时间顺序信息。模型总参数由4M变为1M，声明的同一测试比较中准确率由92%变为93%；没有设备、时延、能耗或内存测量，也没给实际边缘端预算。作者写“resource-constrained real-time edge deployment is achieved”，并想把问题写成“under operating varying conditions”。请界定哪些紧凑性/效果表述成立、哪些现场困难不能编造；保留已给的积极结果而不是把所有结论都删了，不为纯参数比较强制硬件试验。说明工况搭配怎样选、为何这里不能自动写time-varying。给45–70词英文比较段，语气积极但不增加新颖性、部署、实时或显著性证据。仅根据ROOT的P31/P45/P85记录，区分训练成本、设备预测测量与模拟任务时延的来源角色，勿假称读过原文。\n\n",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Retain75% parameter reduction and one-percentage-point accuracy gain within the stated comparison, without inventing hardware, speed, energy, significance or deployment.",
        "Use appropriate operating-condition wording without inventing chronology; distinguish newly supplied P31 training, P45 device and P85 simulated-service reporting roles; write45-70-word positive English prose."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Delete supported parameter/performance results or mandate hardware trials for a narrow parameter-count claim.",
        "Invent edge budgets, real-time readiness, time-varying operation, original-paper access or a prescribed algorithm."
